From C:\Users\DELL\Documents\RAG_Project:
1. Start Qdrant (Docker Desktop must be running first)
docker compose up -d
2. Create venv + install deps (one-time; ~5 GB, takes a few minutes)
python -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
pip install -r requirements.txt
3. Configure keys (one-time)
Copy-Item .env.example .env
Then edit .env and set:
- NVIDIA_API_KEY= → key from https://build.nvidia.com/settings
- LLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY= → key from https://cloud.llamaindex.ai
4. Put PDFs in data/
5. Ingest
python ingest.py --reset
First run downloads BAAI/bge-m3 (~2.5 GB), then parses your PDFs and indexes them.
6. Query
python query.py "What is ...?"
or run python query.py for interactive mode.
Verify Qdrant is up anytime with docker ps; if it's not, start Docker Desktop first.